{"pdfData":[[{"bbox":[73,112,521,161],"type":"header","angle":0,"index":-99999,"text":"浙江省大学生科技竞赛委员会 ","color":{"line":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)","fill":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"is_discarded":true,"id":"010c456e-fc23-47dd-928d-2a8d7d6412d3","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-0"},{"bbox":[368,179,520,200],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":1,"merge_prev":false,"text":"浙科竞〔2026〕25号 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"38dd951a-c359-4b8d-bd48-7c1ec989499d","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-1"},{"bbox":[117,232,476,287],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":2,"level":2,"text":"## 关于举办中国移动杯·第二届浙江省大学生人工智能竞赛的预通知","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"55216eb2-2347-4bf6-882b-ff477bb7d8f5","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-2"},{"bbox":[73,323,164,343],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":3,"merge_prev":false,"text":"各高等院校: ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"218ecf09-afe0-4d7e-9014-8bfa19ecf637","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-3"},{"bbox":[73,352,525,518],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":4,"merge_prev":false,"text":"为强化大学生在人工智能领域的前沿技术探索与应用创新能力，推动理论知识向实际应用的深度转化，实现智能产业应用落地，同时发现和培养一批具备潜力和才华的人工智能未来之星，为浙江省乃至全国人工智能产业发展提供人才支持，经研究，决定举办中国移动杯·第二届浙江省大学生人工智能竞赛。现将有关事项通知如下： ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"e8621faf-7bd5-4242-b132-8feda10f5f4b","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-4"},{"bbox":[105,527,208,546],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":5,"level":2,"text":"## 一、竞赛组织","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"222c2691-607a-4845-a4a3-9953260cba3e","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-5"},{"bbox":[105,555,400,576],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":6,"merge_prev":false,"text":"主办单位：浙江省大学生科技竞赛委员会 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"4915ff4e-f6be-4a28-abce-656fae2ef622","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-6"},{"bbox":[74,585,518,634],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":7,"merge_prev":false,"text":"承办单位：杭州电子科技大学、湖州师范大学、宁波大学、宁波职业技术大学 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"d702f7f7-f79d-4f59-a7f1-dfec55dcd91b","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-7"},{"bbox":[105,642,478,662],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":8,"merge_prev":false,"text":"独家冠名协办单位：中国移动通信集团浙江有限公司 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"c440a450-2116-4b66-ac3f-6e68bc875686","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-8"},{"bbox":[73,671,521,721],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":9,"merge_prev":false,"text":"协办单位：浙江省高等学校图书情报工作指导委员会、宁波方太厨具有限公司、杭州市人工智能学会、中国（浙江）机器人 及智能装备创新中心、杭州网易智企科技有限公司、杭州海康机器人股份有限公司、锐捷网络股份有限公司、杭州金扬智能科技有限公司、江苏润和软件股份有限公司、东阳市人民医院、嘉兴南洋职业技术学院、宁波大学科学技术学院、浙江迈沐智能科技有限公司、湖州市水务集团有限公司、北京智信数图科技有限公司、杭州沃聚网络科技有限公司 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"2b0618f1-3451-44d6-b1bb-0afa56843727","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-9"},{"bbox":[485,740,501,754],"type":"page_number","angle":0,"index":1000009,"text":"1 ","color":{"line":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)","fill":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"is_discarded":true,"id":"2f3be051-dc06-4492-a7aa-7ffd95ed12bf","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-10"}],[{"bbox":[72,104,522,270],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":0,"merge_prev":false,"lines_deleted":true,"text":"","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"2b0618f1-3451-44d6-b1bb-0afa56843727","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-0"},{"bbox":[110,277,241,297],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":1,"level":2,"text":"## （一）竞赛组委会","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"b8fee65b-d0ca-4d0c-b18e-0c8e60490376","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-1"},{"bbox":[72,306,521,386],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":2,"merge_prev":false,"text":"竞赛组委会负责制定竞赛方案, 确定竞赛题目、形式和流程, 聘请专家开展竞赛评审, 认定评审结果, 仲裁争议事项, 对竞赛组织工作进行监督和指导等。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"3f5c25d0-f437-4afd-b49d-04bfa1a35200","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-2"},{"bbox":[110,394,240,413],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":3,"level":2,"text":"## （二）竞赛秘书处","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"5e11c010-368d-4522-85d6-4d10aba09c97","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-3"},{"bbox":[72,423,521,473],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":4,"merge_prev":false,"text":"竞赛秘书处设在杭州电子科技大学，具体承担竞赛的组织工作，并处理日常事务。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"20396d40-021b-495f-a22a-e40fe769c15a","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-4"},{"bbox":[104,480,208,501],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":5,"level":2,"text":"## 二、竞赛内容","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"3bebbdf1-78e8-4e41-b967-600cb3653033","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-5"},{"bbox":[73,509,518,560],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":6,"merge_prev":false,"text":"本次竞赛设算法挑战赛、“揭榜挂帅”赛和专项赛3条赛道。具体赛题及相关要求见附件1和2。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"a4f62328-56a2-4668-9d07-12955f7bfc6d","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-6"},{"bbox":[110,567,240,587],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":7,"level":2,"text":"## （一）算法挑战赛","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"0e81235a-b04d-4c47-aecb-b8d5b0d2e71e","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-7"},{"bbox":[71,597,521,676],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":8,"merge_prev":false,"text":"本赛道设置 3 个赛题供参赛学生选择，分别面向智慧消防、信息安全和医疗健康等前沿领域，聚焦企业实际需求，旨在通过竞赛加速 AI 技术的落地应用与成果转化。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"cd81a6ed-5e17-4b0a-81fd-6529c19993d0","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-8"},{"bbox":[110,683,263,703],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":9,"level":2,"text":"## （二）“揭榜挂帅”赛","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"2a8ed521-5752-4e49-b4e5-aa4f30f1edb4","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-9"},{"bbox":[104,712,520,733],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":10,"merge_prev":false,"text":"本赛道聚焦 AIGC、教育智能体、四足机器人、国产边缘智 能、校园智慧赋能、文旅智能服务、零售服务机器人、工业质检、智慧农业、纺织智能制造、智慧水务等前沿应用领域，联合中国移动、网易智企、海康机器人、锐捷网络、润和软件、金扬智能、迈沐智能和湖州水务等大型国企、行业龙头企业及地方国企、科技企业共同发布赛题11项。参赛团队应立足各行业真实产业痛点与落地需求，自主研发创新方案、搭建智能应用系统、打造实景应用成果，输出完整的项目解决方案、实景应用案例与可落地产业化成果，助力人工智能技术与文旅、教育、工业、农业、水务、零售等多行业深度融合，赋能产业数字化、智能化转型升级。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"2171b72c-021d-4c94-b520-e30fd91c04e2","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-10"},{"bbox":[100,740,116,754],"type":"page_number","angle":0,"index":1000010,"text":"2 ","color":{"line":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)","fill":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"is_discarded":true,"id":"6c9e33a4-3ff4-4916-8361-614905ff32e5","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-11"}],[{"bbox":[72,104,522,357],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":0,"merge_prev":false,"lines_deleted":true,"text":"","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"2171b72c-021d-4c94-b520-e30fd91c04e2","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-0"},{"bbox":[111,365,207,384],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":1,"level":2,"text":"## (三) 专项赛","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"52f3888d-1717-4ca7-a137-df40a07b5467","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-1"},{"bbox":[72,394,522,676],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":2,"merge_prev":false,"text":"本赛道设“AI+信息素养”专项赛（即浙江省大学生“AI+信息素养”大赛）、机器博弈专项赛和“方太”人工智能专项赛等3个赛项，其中“AI+信息素养”专项赛依托浙江省高等学校图书情报工作指导委员会行业资源，由北京智信数图科技有限公司提供赛事平台及培训体系；机器博弈专项赛由中国（浙江）机器人及智能装备创新中心提供软硬件技术保障；“方太”人工智能专项赛依托方太集团专属产业数据、机械臂仿真资源及A100高性能算力评测环境开展赛事。各参赛队可围绕AI信息素养应用、机器博弈算法研发、厨电AI场景落地三大方向自主探索创新场景。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"820504ff-c49e-4824-a3ad-62f4860b4d44","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-2"},{"bbox":[105,683,257,703],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":3,"level":2,"text":"## 三、参赛对象和要求","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"ff7d8d65-4d0c-4d28-aee1-def7f615acff","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-3"},{"bbox":[105,712,518,732],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":4,"merge_prev":false,"text":"浙江省及长三角地区其他省市普通全日制高校在校研究生、 本科生和高职高专学生均可参赛，参赛学生不允许跨校组队，且只能代表学籍所在学校参赛。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"69c3eb95-2ae1-418d-9702-029be2c493c2","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-4"},{"bbox":[486,740,501,754],"type":"page_number","angle":0,"index":1000004,"text":"3 ","color":{"line":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)","fill":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"is_discarded":true,"id":"701130a5-cb72-4a77-a419-581a55c43ee6","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-5"}],[{"bbox":[73,104,521,153],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":0,"merge_prev":false,"lines_deleted":true,"text":"","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":3,"id":"69c3eb95-2ae1-418d-9702-029be2c493c2","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"3-0"},{"bbox":[72,162,521,416],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":1,"merge_prev":false,"text":"算法挑战赛、“揭榜挂帅”赛和“方太”人工智能专项赛均设置本研组和高职高专组，参赛队伍组别按队伍中最高学历参赛者来认定。学生以团队形式参赛，设队长1名，算法挑战赛团队人数（含队长）不超过3人，“揭榜挂帅”赛和“方太”人工智能专项赛团队人数（含队长）不超过8人；算法挑战赛和“揭榜挂帅”赛队长限报1支队伍，未担任队长的团队成员同一赛道限报1支队伍，“方太”人工智能专项赛一名学生限报1支队伍。“AI+信息素养”专项赛和机器博弈专项赛的组别设置、参赛形式和参赛队伍数限制均按照各专项赛规则执行。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":3,"id":"e9809980-96f9-4c82-af0d-1d8d7a350ed1","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"3-1"},{"bbox":[73,423,520,473],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":2,"merge_prev":false,"text":"算法挑战赛和“揭榜挂帅”赛每个学校合计限报50队，专项赛每个赛项每个学校均限报20队。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":3,"id":"e504162b-cc65-481b-8697-834e2fa33fb9","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"3-2"},{"bbox":[72,481,521,560],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":3,"merge_prev":false,"text":"每支参赛队可设 1—2 名指导教师，鼓励企业导师参与指导，但至少需有一名为参赛队所在高校的在职教师，指导教师不允许跨校指导。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":3,"id":"9c8bb730-cc07-4e27-ba84-956e28163eb0","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"3-3"},{"bbox":[105,567,208,587],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":4,"level":2,"text":"## 四、竞赛安排","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":3,"id":"ba75d054-1b87-4636-86f8-8d72b3d93acd","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"3-4"},{"bbox":[111,597,271,616],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":5,"level":2,"text":"## （一）赛题和规则发布","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":3,"id":"692bd878-50ed-46c9-9a76-91f578612162","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"3-5"},{"bbox":[73,625,521,704],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":6,"merge_prev":false,"text":"赛题和规则将于 2026 年 6 月中下旬发布，请各高校在赛题发布后通知学生尽快选题；参加 “揭榜挂帅” 赛和 “方太” 人工智能专项赛的学生应尽快与合作企业建立联系。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":3,"id":"d8e2d468-ec72-488a-8f79-4607f8e62a2f","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"3-6"},{"bbox":[111,712,221,731],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":7,"merge_prev":false,"text":"（二）竞赛报名 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":3,"id":"2159a84b-6d33-4f4b-98aa-14a67943d0f5","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"3-7"},{"bbox":[100,740,116,754],"type":"page_number","angle":0,"index":1000007,"text":"4 ","color":{"line":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)","fill":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)"},"page_idx":3,"is_discarded":true,"id":"4bc6b1e1-518e-4bd7-aa73-492428d92425","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"3-8"}],[{"bbox":[72,104,521,242],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":0,"merge_prev":false,"text":"算法挑战赛、“揭榜挂帅”赛、机器博弈专项赛和“方太”人工智能专项赛报名时间为2026年6月20日至9月18日。各参赛高校请登录报名网站（https://zjrgzncontestc.woczx.com）进行报名，同时将加盖学校竞赛主管部门公章的报名表(见附件3)扫描件发送至竞赛秘书处邮箱 rgznjs@hdu.edu.cn。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":4,"id":"12ec5e78-cc8e-4836-b726-40d7d8614300","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"4-0"},{"bbox":[72,249,521,386],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":1,"merge_prev":false,"text":"“AI+信息素养”专项选拔赛本科和研究生组学校报名时间为2026年6月4日至6月30日，学生报名时间为7月3日至9月17日，报名网站为https://csc.xxsuyang.com；高职高专组学校报名时间为2026年6月9日至7月7日，学生报名时间为7月9日至9月24日，报名网站为https://cscgz.zhixinst.com。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":4,"id":"007925eb-6c3f-414e-a84c-024aa1988bfe","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"4-1"},{"bbox":[111,394,222,413],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":2,"level":2,"text":"## （三）竞赛缴费","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":4,"id":"0f5dc5d2-a3b0-48ec-8ef2-257b037aa59d","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"4-2"},{"bbox":[72,423,521,560],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":3,"merge_prev":false,"text":"本竞赛算法挑战赛、“揭榜挂帅”赛、“AI+信息素养”专项赛和“方太”人工智能专项赛参赛费为800元/队，机器博弈专项赛参赛费为300元/队。参赛费由参赛高校统一缴纳，不得以任何形式向学生收费。转账时务必附言：“人工智能竞赛+参赛学校名称”。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":4,"id":"97f71c35-5064-48d3-86ce-39197ee14fd7","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"4-3"},{"bbox":[72,567,521,675],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":4,"merge_prev":false,"text":"除 “AI+信息素养” 专项赛外的其他各赛道（赛项）参赛费，请各参赛学校于 2026 年 9 月 18 日前转账至杭州电子科技大学账户，账户名称：杭州电子科技大学，开户银行：工行杭州高新支行，账号：1202026209008806216。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":4,"id":"e1aa3f23-160f-4a17-a4d3-5c300c25628b","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"4-4"},{"bbox":[73,683,522,733],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":5,"merge_prev":false,"text":"“AI+信息素养”专项赛参赛费请各参赛学校于2026年10月12日前转账至宁波大学账户，账户名称：宁波大学，开户银 行：工行宁波江北支行，账号：3901130009000002464。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":4,"id":"c1451c15-82d8-4310-a261-41ccae4b43ea","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"4-5"},{"bbox":[486,741,501,754],"type":"page_number","angle":0,"index":1000005,"text":"5 ","color":{"line":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)","fill":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)"},"page_idx":4,"is_discarded":true,"id":"dc3c0b5b-db5b-4104-968b-07e489dd8fa7","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"4-6"}],[{"bbox":[73,105,459,124],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":0,"merge_prev":false,"lines_deleted":true,"text":"","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":5,"id":"c1451c15-82d8-4310-a261-41ccae4b43ea","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"5-0"},{"bbox":[111,133,272,152],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":1,"level":2,"text":"## （四）赛程安排和形式","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":5,"id":"f52ffe1e-12ca-4280-809d-3b69e5bcc61e","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"5-1"},{"bbox":[106,162,204,182],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":2,"level":2,"text":"## 1.算法挑战赛","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":5,"id":"cd783eba-cbd5-40d2-9c7f-890c6ffefd4c","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"5-2"},{"bbox":[72,190,521,298],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":3,"merge_prev":false,"text":"本赛道要求提交代码, 相关提交要求和截止时间等详见算法平台: https://aihuanxin.cn。排名前 30% 的参赛队获得决赛资格, 决赛将于 2026 年 11 月在湖州师范大学举行, 原则上采用现场答辩形式, 具体安排详见决赛通知。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":5,"id":"f6224f98-72d1-43c3-8c2c-3cc2b60c2db1","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"5-3"},{"bbox":[104,306,427,327],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":4,"level":2,"text":"## 2. “揭榜挂帅”赛和“方太”人工智能专项赛","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":5,"id":"67678733-d36e-4560-b9b6-cd592f54340f","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"5-4"},{"bbox":[72,335,522,501],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":5,"merge_prev":false,"text":"要求各参赛队在 2026 年 9 月 24 日前登录系统上传作品，上传成功后由各参赛学校竞赛管理员审核后正式提交至系统。预赛将于 2026 年 10 月中旬开展，竞赛形式为线上评审，成绩排名前 30% 的参赛队获得决赛资格。决赛将于 2026 年 11 月在湖州师范大学举行，原则上采用路演和成果展示（演示）等形式，具体安排详见决赛通知。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":5,"id":"94891dea-65d2-47fb-9391-cab6abae51f6","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"5-5"},{"bbox":[104,509,293,529],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":6,"level":2,"text":"## 3. “AI+信息素养”专项赛","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":5,"id":"4255d460-2dfd-4528-b4d5-2066d4751df7","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"5-6"},{"bbox":[73,539,520,588],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":7,"merge_prev":false,"text":"本赛项的赛程安排、竞赛形式、决赛晋级比例、决赛时间和地点等信息详见专项赛通知。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":5,"id":"44d4b327-0b66-4e66-afb8-18a7d7c619b7","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"5-7"},{"bbox":[104,597,236,617],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":8,"level":2,"text":"## 4.机器博弈专项赛","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":5,"id":"852a1b96-c4dd-4b30-8c3a-4e8e0b5ef325","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"5-8"},{"bbox":[73,625,520,675],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":9,"merge_prev":false,"text":"本赛项决赛将于 2026 年 11 月在湖州师范大学举行, 赛程安排、竞赛形式、决赛晋级比例等信息另行通知。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":5,"id":"2553f794-8522-4c8b-942c-0c224bddfe00","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"5-9"},{"bbox":[105,683,208,703],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":10,"level":2,"text":"## 五、竞赛规则","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":5,"id":"ac45e01a-f713-4296-8aff-2a48eea31d8b","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"5-10"},{"bbox":[105,712,521,733],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":11,"merge_prev":false,"text":"1. 竞赛正式报名结束后，参赛队不得变更赛道或选题，也不 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":5,"id":"613930ea-e505-4907-b50a-63f1b77a2036","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"5-11"},{"bbox":[99,740,116,754],"type":"page_number","angle":0,"index":1000011,"text":"6 ","color":{"line":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)","fill":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)"},"page_idx":5,"is_discarded":true,"id":"ae98a90b-7348-497e-a56c-46331dbc7db6","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"5-12"}],[{"bbox":[73,104,405,125],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":0,"merge_prev":false,"text":"得增减参赛队员，参赛队员不得变更所属队伍。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":6,"id":"ab515341-3498-4b82-842a-2845ea23d959","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"6-0"},{"bbox":[74,132,521,183],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":1,"merge_prev":false,"text":"2. 参赛者需对竞赛数据严格保密，不得将数据用于竞赛以外的任何目的，竞赛结束后需按照组委会要求删除或归还数据。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":6,"id":"6283702d-d483-458a-bef9-70f903541a4e","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"6-1"},{"bbox":[73,190,526,328],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":2,"merge_prev":false,"text":"3. 参赛队需独立完成竞赛，比赛过程中不得有违规行为。提交的所有作品资料应遵守匿名规则，不允许出现参赛队所在学校、团队或队员身份等相关信息，否则取消该队参赛资格。如发现有抄袭其他参赛者、使用未经授权的代码，或有擅自修改竞赛数据、比赛环境等行为，将取消参赛队的参赛资格。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":6,"id":"23d29d8f-98b4-4674-80ae-8678d75ab2c6","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"6-2"},{"bbox":[73,336,526,386],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":3,"merge_prev":false,"text":"4. 为保证竞赛的公正性，竞赛组织方将对评奖结果进行公示，公示期为竞赛结果公示之日起一周，逾期不再受理。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":6,"id":"654d45e5-fc12-4ded-981e-baaf1e6eddfb","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"6-3"},{"bbox":[73,394,520,473],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":4,"merge_prev":false,"text":"5. 参赛作品的知识产权归参赛者所有，但竞赛组织方有权在竞赛宣传、成果展示等相关活动中使用参赛作品的部分或全部内容，无需另行征得参赛队同意。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":6,"id":"20f428ee-81a2-4840-b6bc-49293c3ab02a","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"6-4"},{"bbox":[105,481,208,501],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":5,"level":2,"text":"## 六、奖项设置","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":6,"id":"19015497-531b-4a09-926c-02878beb956a","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"6-5"},{"bbox":[72,509,521,647],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":6,"merge_prev":false,"text":"1. 根据浙江省大学生科技竞赛章程，本届竞赛设一等奖、二等奖、三等奖，获奖比例上限分别为参赛学生的 10%、15%、25%。算法挑战赛、“揭榜挂帅”赛和“方太”人工智能专项赛本研组和高职高专组学生分别独立评奖，其他专项赛按各自竞赛规则执行。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":6,"id":"dc94dcc4-c2ff-476e-b1ed-39177a80392e","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"6-6"},{"bbox":[72,655,521,733],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":7,"merge_prev":false,"text":"2. 竞赛设立 “优秀组织奖”，对竞赛组织工作中表现出色的学校给予表彰奖励；同时评选 “优秀指导教师”，对竞赛指导工作中表现突出的教师个人给予表彰奖励。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":6,"id":"7d7f6ed8-6ca8-457c-b35b-e254d4244f97","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"6-7"},{"bbox":[485,740,502,754],"type":"page_number","angle":0,"index":1000007,"text":"7 ","color":{"line":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)","fill":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)"},"page_idx":6,"is_discarded":true,"id":"bf4a31a9-976e-4c96-a644-6dc1774c3e93","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"6-8"}],[{"bbox":[105,104,208,123],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":0,"level":2,"text":"## 七、联系方式","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":7,"id":"7da7be2a-3d28-437f-8a25-00af11a3c5cf","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"7-0"},{"bbox":[105,133,388,153],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":1,"merge_prev":false,"text":"本届竞赛办公室设在杭州电子科技大学。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":7,"id":"e920e79a-9e62-445b-97d6-7a463baa6555","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"7-1"},{"bbox":[73,162,511,211],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":2,"merge_prev":false,"text":"联系人：张老师，电话：13956467045；颜老师，电话：0571-86919137。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 8